────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PARITY WITH THE WEB SOURCE (data / composition / states / i18n)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
• Gauge  : value = sleep_efficiency_pct (max 100, unit '%'); centre readout
           follows the web RadialGauge (integer→0 dp, else 2 dp, clamped 0..100).
           Colour = efficiencyColor: >95 green, >85 amber, else red — mapped to
           the SI status-color tokens (light/dark/high-contrast aware). Caption
           "Efficiency" at >=2 cols, hidden compact (web `label: isCompact?''`).
• Stats (full only, source order):
    1. Avg Drain/Day = fmtNumber((sentry_off_drain_rate ?? 0) * 24, 2) '%'
    2. Total Sleep   = fmtNumber(Σ state_distribution[asleep|offline].min / 60, 0) 'h'
    3. Wake Events   = recent_events.length (raw integer, no grouping)
• Empty  : Moon (moon.fill) + "No sleep efficiency data" (ContentUnavailableView).
• Compact: isCompact = size.cols <= 1 (registry default 1x2 → compact) → gauge
           only + overlaid freshness; >=2 cols → titled header + gauge + stats.
• States : loading (skeleton) / empty / error (QueryError + Retry) / content,
           plus live / stale / offline freshness chip (ADR-013) + auto-refresh.
• i18n   : every literal resolves through SleepEfficiencyStrings (P1/S10). Keys
           from source: title, description, efficiency, avgDrain, totalSleep,
           hours, wakeEvents, noData, help.sleepEfficiency.body. No English
           literals in the views.
• A11y   : VoiceOver summary seam, Dynamic Type via minimumScaleFactor,
           Reduce-Motion honoured on the gauge arc, labels on every control.
• Telemetry: view.opened emitted once with surface slug "SleepEfficiencyWidget".
• Charts/maps: none (the web source uses none).

